00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Install tgrep in VS Code in a few simple steps.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:09,200
Open the Command Palette, choose “Chat: Install Plugin From Source,”
and paste the repository URL.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:15,400
Start a new chat, build the index once,
then search with focused results.

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:21,400
That can mean less waiting, fewer tokens spent on broad context,
and more precise repository exploration.
